{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>A <strong>dungeon crawler where luck is your only weapon</strong>.</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719900/extras/8322e2af66f17dc0e24dc322139293ca.poster.avif?t=1761407628\" width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719900/extras/8322e2af66f17dc0e24dc322139293ca.webm?t=1761407628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719900/extras/8322e2af66f17dc0e24dc322139293ca.mp4?t=1761407628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action, every event, every discovery is determined by... a <strong>slot machine</strong>. Dive into a <strong>procedurally generated dungeon</strong>, explore its mysterious depths, and let fate pull the strings of your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack, defend, loot, trade, or flee \u2014 <strong>it all depends on the spin</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719900/extras/48c3464c92748c30b19c9e3ee9501404.poster.avif?t=1761407628\" width=1170 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719900/extras/48c3464c92748c30b19c9e3ee9501404.webm?t=1761407628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719900/extras/48c3464c92748c30b19c9e3ee9501404.mp4?t=1761407628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An unpredictable adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action is handled through a <strong>one-armed bandit</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not just luck \u2014 <strong>try to stop the reels at the right moment</strong> to trigger favorable outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine symbols</strong> to unleash powerful effects\u2026 or devastating disasters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt your strategy</strong> based on the spins and the artifacts you unlock along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spend energy</strong> to re-spin certain reels and try to improve your results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719900/extras/71c7a4629a9fb06bde3f9ee34292939a.gif?t=1761407628\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719900/extras/71c7a4629a9fb06bde3f9ee34292939a.poster.avif?t=1761407628\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to expect?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated maps</strong> \u2014 no dungeon is ever the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied weapons, powerful items, and incredible artifacts</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple playable classes</strong>, each with their own unique twists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goblins, skeletons, bandits, ghosts, dragons\u2026 and much worse</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious chests, shops, unexpected blessings or curses</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modify probabilities</strong>, rig your luck\u2026 or suffer the consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permadeath</strong> \u2014 every run is a unique attempt to go deeper than ever before</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Pereelous</strong>, luck is your weapon.<br><strong>Will you twist fate to your advantage\u2026 or become its eternal plaything?</stron